# arXiv processing notes for RQL technical report
#
# Filename 00README.XXX is recognised by arXiv's autoTeX.
# Keep this file in the submission root (inside the zip).

# Build with pdflatex + bibtex (natbib). Prefer including the .bbl
# so arXiv does not need to re-run BibTeX against an external style path.
#
# Primary file:
main.tex

# No special font packages beyond TeX Live defaults (times, T1 fontenc).
# TikZ figures are included via \input from figures/*.tikz — keep those files.

# Do not include:
#   *.aux *.log *.out *.fls *.fdb_latexmk *.blg *.synctex.gz
#   main.pdf (arXiv builds PDF from source; local copy is for human review)

# Bibliography:
#   Prefer shipping main.bbl (generated) + references.bib together.
#   Style: plainnat (natbib).

# Hyperref: already loaded in main.tex; no manual driver override needed.
